{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-42","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-talk-403815094-line","text":"在废弃星系的古城，你遇到了一群远古的渴血巨兽。热气腾腾的喘息声拂到你的脸上……","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-talk-403815095-line","text":"你注意到它们似乎发生了突变…它的皮肤上覆盖一层鎏金硬壳，似乎正饱受突变之苦。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-talk-403815096-line","text":"你与它耷拉的双眸对视。它的胡须上下浮动，你注意到它的身后仍护着几只幼崽……","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-text-6205296961037246967-choice","text":"将它们一并从「痛苦」中释放。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-text-13922691103957781331-effect","text":"出于善意。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-text-2208667844337841296-effect","text":"进入战斗，胜利后获得1个2星祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-42-text-12290007817706122984-effect","text":"进入战斗，胜利后获得1个3星祝福和1个奇物。","speaker":""}]}
